{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1756995506\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1756995506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1756995506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET RUADRIEL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's as breathtaking as a spring garden in full bloom, and just as untamed. Life blossoms beneath her feet: delicate, wild, and utterly captivating. But anger her, and the petals turn to blades, the fragrance to choking spores, and her kisses to slaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her chamber pulses with the rhythm of nature itself\u2014pine and moss in the air, the rustle of leaves, and the slow, warm thrum of life. Ruadriel delights in lacing vines around her lovers, evoking waves of ecstasy with special essences that seep into your very pores. But like any tender bloom, she wilts at rough hands. Those who treat her gently remember nights in her garden as paradise. The rest become fertilizer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1756995506\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Ruadriel as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1756995506\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916500?t=1756995506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916500?t=1756995506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/ed1711a3642ec4bdcfcd670e565607fa8830290f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756995506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/ed1711a3642ec4bdcfcd670e565607fa8830290f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756995506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are over 20 years old.\r\nThis DLC contains explicit adult themes, including nudity and sexual acts. Please be aware and ensure that you are in an appropriate location before playing to avoid causing distress to others."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916500/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1756995506\" width=700 h